    "preamble": "Yakub Obaidur Rehman Shaikh vs The Sr. Police Inspector And Anr on 25 November, 2021 Author: Nitin W. Sambre Bench: Nitin W. Sambre Digitally signed Iresh by Iresh Siddharam Siddharam Mashal Mashal Date: 2021.11.26 10:39:46 +0530 6.2766.21 Ab Ism In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No. 2766 Of 2021 Yakub Obaidur Rehman Shaikh ....Applicant V/s. The State Of Maharashtra .....Respondents And Anr Mr. Mateen Shaikh for the applicant Mr. A. R. Kapadnis App for the State Vijaya Gawade, Api, V. B. Nagar Police Station Coram : Nitin W. Sambre, J. Date: November 25, 2021. P.C.: 1] Applicant is seeking pre-arrest bail in C.R. No. 342/202 registered with V. B. Nagar Police Station for offence punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272, 273 of the Indian Penal Code and under Sections 26, 2(i)(v), 27(3)(e), 3(i), 23(u), 30(2)(a) of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "1 2] Apart from antecedents against the applicant, during recovery 6.2766.21 ABA.doc of material in investigation from co-accused it is discovered that Applicant is regular purchaser of commercial quantity of Gutka/Panmasala material from the applicant by co-accused.",
